  "title": "Endurance expedition",
  "summary": "Ernest Shackleton's ship Endurance became trapped in Weddell Sea pack ice on 18 January 1915 and sank on 21 November 1915. The crew camped on the ice, reached Elephant Island by lifeboat in April 1916, and Shackleton sailed the James Caird to South Georgia to find help. The full party was rescued on 30 August 1916.",
